# Development

## Prerequisites

{%- if execution_model == "web" %}
- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) 20+
- [pnpm](https://pnpm.io/)
{%- else %}
- [Bun](https://bun.sh/) 1.1+
{%- endif %}
- [just](https://just.systems/)
{%- if execution_model != "cli" %}
- [Docker](https://www.docker.com/) (for dependencies)
{%- endif %}

## Setup

```sh
# Install dependencies
{%- if execution_model == "web" %}
pnpm install
{%- else %}
bun install
{%- endif %}

# Copy environment file
cp .env.example .env
```
{% if include_database and database_type == "postgres" %}
## Database

```sh
# Start Postgres
docker compose up -d

# Run migrations
{%- if execution_model == "web" %}
pnpm exec prisma migrate deploy
{%- else %}
bunx prisma migrate deploy
{%- endif %}
```
{% endif %}
## Running Locally
{% if execution_model == "cli" %}
```sh
{{ project_name }} ask "Hello, agent!"
```
{% else %}
```sh
just dev
```

The {% if execution_model == "web" %}app{% else %}API{% endif %} will be available at `http://localhost:3000`.
{% endif %}
## Common Tasks

```sh
# Format and lint
just fmt-fix
just lint-fix

# Type check
just typecheck

# Run tests
just test-unit
just test-all

# Full pre-push check
just gate

# Full check including integration and e2e
just gate-expensive
```

## Testing

Tests are organized by type:

- `tests/unit/` — fast, isolated tests
- `tests/integration/` — tests with real dependencies
- `tests/e2e/` — end-to-end tests

Use `external` in test names for tests that hit external services. These run via `just test-external`.
{% if execution_model != "cli" %}
## Docker

```sh
# Build image
docker build -t {{ project_name }} .

# Run container
docker run -p 3000:3000 {{ project_name }}
```
